#: loadcertwiz.cpp:168
msgid "Enter a passphrase for this callsign certificate."
msgstr "输入此呼号证书的密码。"

#: loadcertwiz.cpp:170
msgid ""
"If you are using a computer system that is shared with others, you should "
"specify a passphrase to protect this certificate. However, if you are using "
"a computer in a private residence no passphrase need be specified."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用密码保护此呼号证书。 如果使用与他人共享的计算机系统，则应指定密码来"
"保护此呼号证书。 但是，如果您在私人住宅中使用计算机，则无需指定密码。"

#: loadcertwiz.cpp:172
msgid ""
